#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6600
msgid ""
"Reopen apps, saved documents and Files tabs after Windows. Zen follows its tab-restore preference. Save your work first; private tabs aren't restored."
msgstr ""

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6624
